Inkwell license scope

The MIT license below applies to this repository except for:

- The first-party Inkwell API server in packages/api, web dashboard in
  packages/web, database source and configuration in supabase/, and their
  modifications and derivatives, which are governed by packages/api/LICENSE
  (FSL-1.1 Ink Labs Extended 1.0, an extension of FSL 1.1 with additional
  provisions and a two-year MIT future grant).
- Components or files carrying separate third-party license notices, which
  remain governed by their respective licenses.

The whole packages/shared package, including its runtime, providers, and
node-host exports, and the CLI in packages/cli remain MIT-licensed immediately.
Moving covered code alone does not change its license. Separate grants by the
relevant rights holders and earlier license grants remain unaffected.
The database scope does not include the Supabase platform or users' stored data.
See docs/licensing.md for the scope map and explanatory examples.

